t": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What did you use to do with your families on Christmas when you were young? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: We used to go skating. We would open our presents, then head to the Boston Common skating rink. We would drink hot chocolate and race around for hours!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds like fun!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Have you ever heard of the Freedom Trail? Many families follow the trail on Christmas Day. It's kind of a tradition. Dad, Sis and I always walked the trail. We loved it and it gave Mom a break!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Gilly, Teddy and I wrote and performed plays for Christmas. We put together costumes and wrote out dialogues. We rehearsed for hours. Our various relatives were very good sports.", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "image": "engenn6le18ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I haven't had a Christmas like this one for a while. We're a new kind of family don't you think?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. We've had Christmas together for a few years now. We've made our own traditions. I would dread the holidays when I was alone here.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: To many more Christmases together. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Cheers to that!", "id": 3, "time": "40000", "image": "engenn6le18ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}